  "description": "Based on a design from the collection Stray Aliens #6 - Ember Elemeind\nhttps://opensea.io/assets/ethereum/0x495f947276749ce646f68ac8c248420045cb7b5e/57124830429581407560204282384407541915263222877884187177766534217117124788225\n\n\"Ember is the 2nd of the Elemeind sisters to be located by our team. We were investigating seismic activity near the Elemeind's home planet & a distant fireball led us to her right away. She said that she will be willing to live among & help the humans for a chance to cool things down with her sister.\n\nEmber is a fiery spirit with an appetite for all sorts of fun! Ember has rare features not yet seen in a Stray Alien. We have been warned that Ember has a hot streak of erupting when she's angry. During the screening process, we did not observe anything from Ember that set off alarms. She should be fully compatible with laid-back humans, despite what her sister Floraleen has said about her.\"",
